      "lines": [
        "定理1. 如果两条直线中的一条在平面内，而另一条与平",
        "面相交于不属于前一条直线的一点，那么这两条直线是异面",
        "直线."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "异面直线 $a$ 和 $b$ 将用符号 $a\\dot{-}b$ 表示. 注意：过异面直线",
        "不可能作平面."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "习　题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "36",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "36. 1) 在正方体的模型中，指出它有多少对棱在异面直",
        "线上.",
        "2) 以教室里的家具为对象，指出异面直线的模型."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "37",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "37. 过已知点作已知直线的异面直线."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "38",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "38. 下列命题正确吗？ $1^{\\circ}$) “如果两条直线没有公共点，",
        "那么它们平行”.",
        "2) $(a\\dot{-}b,b\\dot{-}c)\\Longrightarrow(a\\dot{-}c)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "39",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "39. 已知，$A\\in\\alpha$，$B\\in\\beta$，$\\alpha\\cap\\beta=m$. 直线 $AB$ 和 $m$ 的相关",
        "位置，除了在图 15 上表示的",
        "情况外，还有其他情况吗？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "40",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$40^{\\circ}$. 说出四面体的两",
        "条在异面直线上的棱（图",
        "12）. 四面体有多少对这样",
        "的棱？"
      ]
    },
